<title>UK: Abbey National sets 200 mln sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 200 mln sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    20.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.95     PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    SWISS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA/AA2    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
